    "setup": [
      "MS/TP address is set in binary on an 8-way DIP switch (switch 1 = least significant bit).",
      "Baud rate on DIP 1-3: 9600, 19200, 38400, 57600, 76800 or 115200.",
      "Addresses 0 to Max_Master make it an MS/TP master; higher addresses make it a slave.",
      "Default device instance is 1345000 plus the MS/TP address; writing 4194303 restores the default.",
      "Max_Master defaults to 127, Max_Info_Frames to 1."
    ],
    "gotchas": [
      "While Safety run (BV 5) is on, writes to the position and slat commands (AV 1-8) are ignored and flagged OVERRIDDEN.",
      "Travel time and slat set-up values (AV 17-57, BV 7-10) are stored in flash; don't write them cyclically.",
      "Local internal keys show as OVERRIDDEN on the binary inputs."
    ]
